	 + clean water{weight=1000}
	 - <call>returnImage "https://climaxweb.net/templates/images/0228c80a7e10f7de96697a909f84abfc--giphy-2.gif" "200" "200"</call> We believe that water is not only a human need but an essential human right <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~1|6^9~,[[|6^9~https:\/\/climaxweb.net\/templates\/images\/0228c80a7e10f7de96697a909f84abfc--giphy-2.gif|6^9~,|6^9~200|6^9~,|6^9~200|6^9~]]],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "That's why we invented Pure Shores CPS technology. 🏆" "It is a low-cost technology capable of large scale impact (providing safe water for up to 2,000 people per day." "Put simply, Pure Shores brings these towns the ability to create their own sodium hypochlorite, the global gold standard for water purification."</call> <call>displayresoptions "That's Great!" </call>{topic=661051189567517200}

	 + sanitation and hygiene{weight=1000}
	 - Water + Sanitation + Hygiene = Permanent improvements in community health. 🌍 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "Do you agree? 🤷" "So to work towards it and develop Pure Shores that was uniquely developed to go beyond purifying water." "Which includes hand washing, clinic sterilization, food preparation and eating hall disinfection, maternal room sterilization, medical tool sterilization, all-purpose cleaner, baby bottle disinfection."</call> <call>displayresoptions "Yeah, I would love to" "Not now, Maybe later" </call>{topic=648991992255875300}

	 + maternal health{weight=1000}
	 - Do you know 15% of maternal death occurs due to infection? 🤷 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "We know it because one of the founders of Untapped Shores spent two years working for Merck for Mothers. 🤰" "Our clinic leaders use Pure Shores to erase maternal infection: 👇 @-LineBreak ✔ Sterilization of the birthing suite and all medical tools @-LineBreak ✔ Hand washing @-LineBreak ✔ Purified water is used during birth and issues to the mother to bring home @-LineBreak ✔ Diluted chlorine bleach is distributed (and refills provided) to aid in sterilization at home."</call> <call>displayresoptions "Yeah, I would love to" "Not now, Maybe later" </call>{topic=648991992255875300}

	 + disaster relief{weight=1000}
	 - When natural disasters occur it can instantly send a population into chaos. <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "And if the water treatment infrastructure is compromised as a result of the event, a water and sanitation crisis becomes an instant public health priority. 🚰" "Do you agree? 🤷" "So, we make sure that our Pure Shores CPS provides the bridge to purify mass amounts of water until adequate aid can reach the victims. ✌"</call> <call>displayresoptions "Yeah, I would love to" "Not now, Maybe later" </call>{topic=648991992255875300}
